# Dependency patches preserve the upstream bundle's mixed indentation so that
# patch-package can match and replay it exactly.
#
# `-trailing-space` too: in a unified diff a context line for a BLANK source
# line is required to be a lone space, so a patch that touches a hunk
# containing one necessarily carries lines our whitespace rule would reject.
# Stripping them would leave a patch that no longer applies.
patches/*.patch whitespace=-space-before-tab,-trailing-space
